        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer weekly cultural and interactive educational topics including leadership development, our values, updates on Medicaid and Medicare billing requirements, updates on new regulations or legislation, infection control, emerging healthcare service alternatives and other relevant clinical, business and industry specific coursework.",
