        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Increasingly, we are competing with home health and community-based providers who have developed programs designed to provide services to seniors outside a facility-based setting, potentially decreasing the time they need the higher level of care provided in a skilled nursing facility.",
