        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "New Market CEO and New Ventures Programs — In order to broaden our reach into new markets, and in an effort to provide existing leaders in our company with the entrepreneurial opportunity and challenge of entering a new market and starting a new business, we established our New Market CEO program in 2006.",
