        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Reimbursement for Other Ancillary Services — Other ancillary revenue, such as mobile diagnostics and medical transportation, is primarily derived from Medicare, Medicaid, managed care and private payors at rates we establish based upon the services we provide and market conditions in the area of operation.",
